      "description": "Calls from ESO to Vault (externalsecret_provider_api_calls_count) by call (Login, ReadSecretData, LookupSelf, RevokeSelf) and status. Each refresh is Login → Read → Revoke. Source: ESO official dashboard v2.15.0 (docs/snippets/dashboard.json) (API calls by provider).",
